internal_source/rdma
# Repo root of @com_google_protobuf (REPO.bazel, local_repository in MODULE.bazel). The main
# repo has no //3rdparty/protobuf: labels; it is consumed only via @com_google_protobuf. But
# REPO.bazel, unlike the old WORKSPACE, does not make wildcards skip that subtree, so
# protobuf's bundled cc_test (needing @submodule_gmock — declared only by its original
# WORKSPACE) would land in the `bazel test ...` ut target surface.
3rdparty/protobuf
# Repo roots of @rtp_extension / @arch_config (with REPO.bazel). internal_source is mounted
# into the workspace as a symlink, so the main repo would discover them a second time; shadow
# packages reference same-extension siblings by apparent name (@solar etc.), visible only
# inside the extension's repos, and would necessarily fail to resolve in the main repo.
internal_source/deps
internal_source/bazel
open_source